    "title": "Triple Body Butter -Lavendar",
    "descriptionHtml": "<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini\">\n<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">DYU Triple Body Butter - Lavender blends rich cocoa, mango, and shea butters with coconut oil and lavender essential oil to intensely moisturize and soothe dry, tired, or irritated skin. </span></li>\n<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Calming Lavandula Angustifolia essential oil provides a gentle floral scent that promotes relaxation, relieves skin redness, and helps restore balance to sensitive or inflamed skin. </span></li>\n<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">The creamy blend of mango and cocoa butter delivers long-lasting hydration and skin-softening benefits, perfect for daily use to heal dry patches and promote silky-smooth texture. </span></li>\n<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Shea butter and coconut oil protect against environmental stress while deeply nourishing the skin barrier, making this body butter ideal for dry climates or post-shower skin repair. </span></li>\n<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Fortified with antioxidant-rich vitamin E, this chemical-free, fast-absorbing formula enhances skin elasticity, reduces flakiness, and leaves a soft, radiant glow without greasiness.</span></li>\n</ul>",
